Dear all,

In response to my query about summarize, xYplot and missing groups, Frank 
Harrell noticed a coding problem: I had specified group= and not groups=; 
having tried that adjustment, I find a) that xYplot seems to be capable of 
recognising group vs groups as the same call, and that this does not fix 
the plotting error.  Interestingly, changing the type="" preference from b 
to p (both to points) allows the plotting to continue, but suspends the 
lines connecting points of the same group, and suspends the labeling of 
groups (that is my fix so far).

He also had some handy suggestions about Cbind in hmisc.

cheers
andrew

