Andrew,

>  -----Original Message-----
> From:         Andrew Beckerman [mailto:a.p.beckerman at stir.ac.uk] 
> Sent: Sunday, 22 July 2001 3:00 AM
> To:   S-news
> Subject:      [S] multiple plot display
> 
> Dear SPLUSERS
