The crucial lines are (S-PLUS 3.4 at least)

        else if(missing(to))
                from + (0:(length.out - 1)) * by

so in your first example

> 2 + (0:(20-1))*c(1,2)
 [1]  2  4  4  8  6 12  8 16 10 20 12 24 14 28 16 32 18 36 20 40

You might now see the pattern (40 pairs)

